Languages: Python (model, backend), JavaScript/TypeScript (frontend).

ML: PyTorch or TensorFlow/Keras, torchvision/timm, scikit-learn, OpenCV, Albumentations; Grad-CAM for explanations.

Backend: FastAPI, SQLite or PostgreSQL (PostGIS optional), a rules module in plain Python.

